t, and the selling price is $1237.575 per unit. Cash collection from this customer comes between 11.0 days and 42.0 days after shipment. Siemens Digital orders the same EV_battery every 19.0 weeks flat, with demand ranging from 2544102.0 units to 3406723.0 units. Its delivery expectation is between 15.0 weeks and 16.0 weeks, it follows a pure lost-sales policy when inventory is unavailable, and the product sells to this customer at $4318.574 per unit. Payment from Siemens Digital is received between 10.0 days and 71.0 days later. Overall, the node structure links 6 suppliers—GlassCore Ltd., PrecisionParts, MegaSupply, BatteryTech, ChipCo, and FastChip Corp.—into the 2 facilities, Assembly Hub and Logistics Center, with all raw materials routed into Assembly Hub before EV_battery units move downstream.

