 TechCorp buys laptop units with orders arriving between 25.0 hours and 43.0 hours, in quantities ranging from 119327.0 units to 2264479.0 units, and expects delivery in 10.0 hours to 13.0 hours; if stock is short, available units are shipped and the remainder is lost. TechCorp pays a selling price of $3139.896 per unit and settles invoices exactly 86.0 hours later. Siemens Digital also purchases laptops, with order arrivals averaging 27.0 hours, a fixed demand of 3765054.0 units per order, delivery windows between 16.0 hours and 22.0 hours, the same partial-fulfillment lost-sales arrangement, a selling price of $1545.914 per unit, and payment exactly 68.0 hours after delivery. The model runs for a horizon of 365 hours with 10 replications.

