iving on an exponential pattern averaging 14.0 days; demand is around 1682674.0 units with variability of 19498.0 units, shipment lead time is 2.0 days, selling price is $3041.792 per unit, and payment comes 33.0 days after delivery. Its fulfillment rule is partial shipment with the remainder backordered. TechCorp purchases laptop every 45.0 days, with order size ranging from 2854003.0 to 3190664.0 units, customer lead time between 2.0 and 21.0 days, selling price of $4009.776 per unit, and payment terms between 35.0 and 40.0 days; here too, available units ship first and the balance is backordered. The model runs for a total of 730 days, with 10 replications.

