stomer lead time; the item sells at $2778.725 per unit, customer payment is due after 71.0 days, and any unmet demand is simply lost. TechCorp purchases CPU every 55.0 weeks, in volumes between 2162926.0 units and 3078688.0 units, with a 20.0-week lead time to the customer. CPU is sold at $2363.505 per unit, and TechCorp pays in 20.0 to 22.0 days; here too, shortages mean lost sales. The model runs in weeks over a 365-week horizon, with results collected after a 30-week warm-up period and 1 replication.

