ent arrives 12.0 weeks after delivery, and under the partial shipment policy whatever is available is sent while the remaining demand is lost. Broadcom Limited purchases laptop, with orders arriving exponentially at an average of 23.0 weeks, each for a constant 1794157.0 units. Customer lead time for laptop runs from 5.0 weeks to 15.0 weeks, the price is $1084.929 per unit, and payment is received between 31.0 weeks and 54.0 weeks; here too, available units are shipped and any shortfall is lost. The modeled network explicitly links GlassCore Ltd. and GlobalComponents to Manufacturing Site, and then sends both industrial_sensor and laptop onward to the Logistics Center. The scenario is evaluated over a 500-week horizon with 10 replications.

