 days. On the demand side, Ross Associates buys the laptop, placing orders every 17.0 to 20.0 days, with demand centered around 3857325.0 units and varying by about 296292.0 units. Customer shipments take 14.0 days, and any unmet orders are backordered rather than lost. The laptop sells at $72.996 per unit, and customer payments are received between 21.0 days and 59.0 days later. The full model runs for a 500-day horizon with 1 replication.

